<title>UK: CCCC sets 600 million French franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>CCCC sets 600 million French franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was</p>
<p>announced by lead manager Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE CREDIT DU COOPERATIF</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.10	MATURITY    06.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+50 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> MGT	  20 BP     UND	  70 BP     SELL CONC   80 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED OAT 5.50 PCT 2007 AND 8.50 PCT 2008</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
